== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either increases the chance of changing the room drop reward to a [[Cards and Runes|tarot or playing card]] by 20% and increases the chance of adding a card or rune to rewards to 66%. Having both increases these chances to respectively 30% and 100%.

